sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant A as api
    box rgb(230,240,255) Backend
    participant B as worker
    participant C as audit
    end
    autonumber
    U->>A: request
    A->>+B: dispatch
    Note left of C: watched async
    B-->>A: done
    deactivate B
    A-)U: notify
    autonumber off
    A->>C: log
